WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Hello. My name is Valentina Vissarionovna Tyan. I am a senior-category obstetrician-gynecologist, an aesthetic gynecology physician and a pelvic surgeon. Today I would like to tell you about a remarkable product.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:50.000
My second scientific dissertation focused on human papillomavirus and associated diseases in women of reproductive age. Science has shown that viruses play an important role in immunopathogenesis and may contribute to malignant transformation and cancer.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:22.000
The immune system plays a very important role in the pathogenesis of viral infections. In women with HPV and immune-system disorders, cellular changes toward precancerous processes occur more often, and the risk of carcinogenesis is higher.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Carcinogenesis is the transition from a precancerous state toward cancer. NK cells, or natural killer cells, play an important role in immunity. They recognize abnormal agents and antigens and activate the immune system.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:19.000
They are also involved in the antiviral immune response. We have a product called HemoHIM. When Professor Edelev reviewed its composition, he noted the product's formulation.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Professor Edelev highlighted the HemoHIM ingredients: cnidium, angelica and peony, discussing their properties and their combination in the formula.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:03:14.000
According to the speaker, this combination has a beneficial effect on the cardiovascular system and blood vessels. She also refers to research concerning protection of the hematopoietic system, liver and kidneys from radiation exposure.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:37.000
The speaker says that related reports were published between 2002 and 2016 and mentions clinical studies involving groups of women with breast cancer and cervical cancer.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:04:09.000
According to the speaker, participants received HemoHIM at 6 g per day, and an effect on the incidence of severe leukopenia during chemotherapy or radiotherapy was observed compared with a control group.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:30.000
The speaker describes a reduction in severe leukopenia complications among women receiving HemoHIM and says the results were presented at an international conference in Mumbai, India, in October 2016.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:05:01.000
According to the speaker, the conference discussed using HemoHIM as an adjunct to standard cancer treatment. She also mentions a 2006 study involving subclinically healthy men.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:27.000
The speaker says that taking HemoHIM at 6 g per day was associated with an increase in the NK-cell population, which she links to an effect on the immune system.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:06:03.000
NK cells are natural killer cells involved in recognizing viral and bacterial pathology and in antitumor defense. The speaker explains the importance of NK-cell immune surveillance.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:22.000
Chemotherapy is used to treat cancer, including drugs based on cisplatin, which can also have toxic effects.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:56.000
The speaker discusses cisplatin's negative effects on the liver and kidneys and says HemoHIM use before and during chemotherapy has been studied in relation to reducing this toxic effect.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:17.000
According to the speaker, HemoHIM's safety in relation to the liver and kidneys was assessed using biochemical tests taken before, during and after use.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:34.000
The speaker describes HemoHIM as a botanical product used as additional support for patients with serious illnesses.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:08:17.000
As an obstetrician-gynecologist, she discusses her practice and says she recommends HemoHIM to some patients as an additional product to support the body during infectious illness, recovery and the postoperative period.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:39.000
In the speaker's personal observations, patients who followed these recommendations showed better expected results after therapy and recovered better.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:09:10.000
She compares this experience with patients receiving a standard course of therapy without HemoHIM and describes cases in which repeat procedures or extended treatment were required.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:32.000
The speaker says HemoHIM helps her in clinical practice and emphasizes that good prevention is better than good treatment.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:56.000
She encourages people not to wait for a serious problem before taking care of their health, but to begin preventive care while they still feel well.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:10:23.000
According to the speaker, restoring the immune system takes time—on average eight to twelve weeks. She discusses the role of natural products in supporting the body.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:46.000
The speaker notes that immune activity and NK-cell production may decline with age and emphasizes their role in immune surveillance.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:11:21.000
She stresses prevention, a healthy lifestyle, proper nutrition, physical activity and the sensible use of botanical products to support the body.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:35.000
Movement and these basic habits can help preserve health for longer and support healthy longevity. Stay healthy.
